sequenceDiagram
    actor M as Member
    participant FE as Front End
    participant S as Library System
    participant DB as Data Store
    actor L as Librarian

    M->>FE: Search books (title/author/category)
    FE->>S: searchBooks(criteria)
    S->>DB: query matching books
    DB-->>S: book list with copy availability
    S-->>FE: search results
    FE-->>M: show results with availability

    M->>FE: Select book, submit borrow request
    FE->>S: requestBorrow(memberId, bookId)
    S->>DB: check member eligibility (fines, active loans)
    DB-->>S: member status
    S->>DB: create borrow request (Pending)
    S-->>L: new request notification

    L->>S: review and confirm request
    S->>DB: record loan (borrowDate, dueDate = +14 days)
    S->>DB: set copy status = On Loan
    S-->>FE: loan confirmed
    FE-->>M: show loan with due date

    Note over M,L: Later, when the book is returned
    M->>L: return the book
    L->>S: processReturn(loanId)
    S->>DB: set returnDate, copy status = Available
    alt returnDate is after dueDate
        S->>S: calculateFine(daysOverdue x 5 EGP)
        S->>DB: create Fine for member
        S-->>L: fine recorded
    else on time
        S-->>L: return completed, no fine
    end
    S->>DB: check reservation queue
    opt reservation queue not empty
        S-->>M: notify next member copy is available
    end
